ur, envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 15' à allure course en continues","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Les 1h30 d'effort qu'on te propose aujourd'hui vont continuer de bien développer ton endurance longue. Essaie encore une fois de courir relâché(e) et de finir ta sortie en ayant l'impression d'en avoir encore sous le pied !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"trail_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EC_65","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":339,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":65,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"AC_15_Indif","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Allure course","value":420,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z1","abstract":true,"slug":"race","context":"intensity","perception":"target"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":2,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1791158400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a68a2dfce2d2a7e262eb244","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1791158400000,"sessionIndex":4,"choRecommendation":5,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[],"commercial":[]},"2":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"YbBFRyt1QkiVKE6SJD1x-Q","name":"Compote de pommes énergétique","form