:"Te détendre, penser au relâchement, à une foulée efficace, à travailler un détail technique ou tout simplement profiter de ton environnement... Les objectifs sont multiples en footing, choisis celui qui te fait le plus envie aujourd'hui... mais surtout cours lentement, contrôle ton allure !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":0,"weekDate":1791763200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1800,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"S30_5x1-2_Cote_Affutage","description":"Séance de seuil 30' **EN COTE** où tu vas enchaîner **5 répétitions de 1'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer et te laisser le temps de redescendre.","displayName":"Seuil 30","coachAdvice":"Sortie intense de ta semaine. Fais en sorte d'y arriver le plus reposé(e) possible pour la valider sans soucis.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"trail_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"WU_20 ","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":327,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartT